  "name": "AptToSell Follow-Up Event Registry 2026 — Pilot",
  "description": "Public pilot registry for 103 first observed follow-up apartment supply events in South Korea in 2026. All 103 rows have numeric notice IDs and canonical official source links; 13 rows are directly primary-verified and 90 are corroborated with ApplyHome links.",
